Implemented `--group-by-category` with filtering before grouping, sorted categories, summed quantities, and exact decimal stock values formatted as two-digit JSON strings.

Ungrouped output is preserved. Invalid CSV returns exit code 2 without a traceback. README includes a grouped example and expected output.

All 10 tests passed with `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v`. Supplied tests were unchanged.
